=== layout: one-panel

# [*Don't Panic*]{color=red}

@body

- If you experience internet troubles or non-academic distractions during a quiz/exam\:
  - 1. Don't panic
  - 2. Stop and close the quiz/exam without looking at all the questions
  - 3. [Contact me immediately]{color=red}, preferably via Discord, but you do not need to rush
- Note\: Once class begins, I no longer check my email.
- If you haven't looked at all the questions, I can reset the quiz/exam
- If you have looked at some questions, I can create a new custom quiz/exam with only the portion that you haven't seen yet.

=== layout: one-panel

# *Illness Policy*

@body

- Since COVID, I am trying to be more considerate of student illnesses.
- If you are sick, let me know. I will provide an extension.
- If a major event interferes (car accident, etc.), again contact me.
- Communication is always helpful.

